---
// About — editorial split. The dish gallery role has moved to VisualStory,
// so this section can finally do what About is meant to do: tell a story.
//
// Left column: oversized display headline + deeper body + signature line.
// Right column: a single large portrait of the chef in the kitchen with a
// smaller dish-detail inset overlapping its bottom-left — the way a
// hospitality magazine spread treats a chef profile.
---

<section id="about" class="bg-ink-light py-24 sm:py-28">
  <div data-reveal class="container mx-auto grid max-w-[1180px] items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
    {/* Text column — 6 of 12 */}
    <div class="lg:col-span-6">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-gold-light">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block size-1.5 rotate-45 bg-ember"></span>
        01 · The truth
      </span>

      <h2 class="mt-7 font-display text-[clamp(2.75rem,6vw,5.25rem)] font-normal leading-[0.92] tracking-[0.02em] text-sand">
        Cooked for you.
        <em class="mt-3 block font-serif italic font-normal text-[0.42em] tracking-[0.01em] text-gold-light">
          — and no one else.
        </em>
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-7 max-w-[520px] text-[16.5px] leading-[1.75] text-sand">
        The medina has a thousand restaurants. None of them know your name, your allergies,
        your daughter who only eats plain rice, or that it’s your anniversary.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-[520px] text-[15.5px] leading-[1.8] text-sand-muted">
        A private chef changes the maths. The menu is written for your table. Courses arrive
        when you’re ready, not when the kitchen is. The terrace is yours, the pace is yours,
        and the only people in the room are people you chose to be there.
      </p>

      {/* Signature line — the editorial closer */}
      <div class="mt-10 flex items-center gap-4 border-t border-gold/15 pt-7">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block size-1.5 rotate-45 bg-ember"></span>
        <span class="font-serif italic text-[15px] text-gold-light">
          Hand-written menus · Souk-fresh · Discreet service
        </span>
      </div>

      <a
        href="#booking"
        class="group mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-gold-light transition hover:text-sand"
      >
        Book your dinner
        <span
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="inline-block h-px w-10 bg-gold/60 transition group-hover:w-16 group-hover:bg-ember"
        ></span>
      </a>
    </div>

    {/* Editorial image column — chef portrait + inset dish */}
    <div class="relative lg:col-span-6">
      <figure class="relative overflow-hidden border border-gold/20 bg-ink">
        <div class="aspect-[4/5]">
          <img
            src="/chef-cooking-marrakech-kitchen.webp"
            alt="The chef working at the stove, finishing a tagine with preserved lemon"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-ember/12 mix-blend-multiply" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink/45 via-transparent to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        {/* Caption strip along the bottom */}
        <figcaption class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-sand">
          <span>At the stove · 18:42</span>
          <span class="text-gold-light">Marrakech</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      {/* Overlapping inset — a dish detail, sits at the bottom-left corner */}
      <figure class="absolute -bottom-8 -left-6 hidden w-[44%] overflow-hidden border border-gold/25 bg-ink shadow-[0_22px_50px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.65)] sm:block">
        <div class="aspect-[5/4]">
          <img
            src="/lamb-tagine-prunes-almonds.webp"
            alt="Lamb tagine with prunes and toasted almonds, plated"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-ember/15 mix-blend-multiply" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </figure>

      {/* Vertical decorative rule along the right edge — luxury hospitality detail */}
      <span
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="absolute -right-3 top-8 bottom-8 hidden w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-gold/40 to-transparent lg:block"
      ></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
